Z||000016||frontal lobe||11-03-2000||06:56 PM||||By the way, that's save 10% of your GROSS, not net.  The savings rate (% of income) in our country is pathetic.  If you do 10%, you will be WAY ahead of most people.||||reg||1
Z||000017||Ed||11-04-2000||11:42 AM||||There's lots of web sites too. <P>Smartmoney.com is a place to start.  All the investment firms have sites where you can get advice.  Dreyfus, Oppenheimer, Schwab, etc. <P>||||reg||1
